vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Harden initialization:
- Restrict `init` to the factory and make it one-time:
  ```solidity
  function init(address _builderAdmin) external {
      require(msg.sender == FACTORY, "NOT_FACTORY");
      require(builderAdmin == address(0), "ALREADY_INIT");
      builderAdmin = _builderAdmin;
  }
  ```
- Alternatively, set `builderAdmin` in the constructor (passing it in init code) and remove `init` entirely.
- Consider emitting an event on admin initialization/changes (and ideally disallow changes).
